 s-infinite-wrench-20-nov-2026\n\nThe SF Neo-Futurists perform The Infinit
 e Wrench: 30 plays in 60 minutes\, with the audience shouting the number 
 of the one they want next. Nobody plays a character\, and if a performer 
 is drinking a beer\, it is a beer. The performance takes place on Friday\
 , November 20 at 447 Minna.
